      propertyPath: letterContent
      value: "Fascinating! This blue fungi species is able to generate electrical currents through photosynthesis! They are also responsive to our artificial light sources. The civilization that resided here seems to have used these fungi to power up their mechanisms. I'll have to set up a camp at the old ruins to study these specimens closer. \r\n"
